description:
Implement a hook that attaches a `MutationObserver` to a ref element. The provided callback fires whenever DOM mutations occur matching the given options. The observer disconnects on unmount.

**Example:**
```tsx
const ref = useRef(null);
useMutationObserver(ref, (mutations) => console.log(mutations), { childList: true });
return <div ref={ref} />;
```

